msgid "Spaces a tab renders as. Applies to files opened after the change."
msgstr "制表符显示为的空格数。适用于更改后打开的文件。"

msgid "Which IDE's default shortcuts to use for the commands this editor supports."
msgstr "此编辑器支持的命令使用哪个 IDE 的默认快捷键。"

msgid "Also: Ctrl+MouseWheel, Ctrl+'+'/'-', Ctrl+0 resets."
msgstr "另外:Ctrl+鼠标滚轮、Ctrl+'+'/'-',Ctrl+0 重置。"

msgid "When ATE is the External Script Editor, non-text requests (solutions, binaries, project sync) are forwarded here."
msgstr "当 ATE 是外部脚本编辑器时,非文本请求(解决方案、二进制文件、项目同步)将转发到此处。"

msgid "Compiler-accurate colors and Go to Definition. If the project has no Roslyn, enabling installs the bundled MIT-licensed Roslyn assemblies (see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES)."
msgstr "编译器级准确的颜色和转到定义。如果项目没有 Roslyn,启用时将安装捆绑的 MIT 许可 Roslyn 程序集(参见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES)。"

msgid "Animate wheel scrolling instead of stepping line by line."
msgstr "滚轮滚动使用动画而不是逐行跳动。"

msgid "Default view when opening .md files: rendered (WYSIWYG) when on, source when off. The MD/source toggle still switches per tab."
msgstr "打开 .md 文件时的默认视图:开启时为渲染(所见即所得),关闭时为源码。MD/源码切换仍可按标签页切换。"

msgid "How many entries File → Recent Files keeps (1-30)."
msgstr "文件 → 最近的文件保留的条目数(1-30)。"

msgid "Check GitHub for new releases and offer to install them."
msgstr "在 GitHub 上检查新版本并提示安装。"

msgid "Days between automatic update checks. 1 = daily; never more often than once per day."
msgstr "自动更新检查的间隔天数。1 = 每天;每天最多检查一次。"

msgid "No file open.\nFile → New, File → Open…, or right-click a text asset in the Project window."
msgstr "没有打开的文件。\n文件 → 新建、文件 → 打开…,或在 Project 窗口中右键单击文本资源。"

msgid "Updating ADKOM Text Editor…\nPlease wait — the editor will reload when the update completes."
msgstr "正在更新 ADKOM Text Editor…\n请稍候 — 更新完成后编辑器将重新加载。"

msgid "(unknown version)"
msgstr "(未知版本)"

msgid "A real code editor, living right inside the Unity Editor."
msgstr "一个真正的代码编辑器,就在 Unity 编辑器内。"

msgid "100% Editor-only — nothing ships in player builds."
msgstr "100% 仅限编辑器 — 玩家构建中不包含任何内容。"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "确定"

msgid "Go to Definition needs Semantic Features, which are currently disabled.\n\nEnable them now? The semantics module — and, if your project has no Roslyn, the bundled MIT-licensed Roslyn assemblies — will be installed automatically."
msgstr "转到定义需要语义功能,当前已禁用。\n\n现在启用吗?语义模块(如果项目没有 Roslyn,还有捆绑的 MIT 许可 Roslyn 程序集)将自动安装。"

msgid "Enable and Install"
msgstr "启用并安装"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Semantic features are still installing or compiling — try again in a moment."
msgstr "语义功能仍在安装或编译中 — 请稍后重试。"

